          %title Contents
          %div{:style => "float:right;margin:-20px 20px 5px 20px;"}
            %a{:href => "https://nyuad.nyu.edu/en/research/faculty-labs-and-projects/cqts.html"}
              %img{:alt => "animated logo of CQTS", :src => "https://ncatlab.org/schreiber/files/CQTS-logo_animated.gif", :width => "380"}/
          %p
            The
            %em
              %a{:href => "https://nyuad.nyu.edu/en/research/faculty-labs-and-projects/cqts.html"} Center for Quantum and Topological Systems
            (CQTS, launched in 2021) is a research center within the
            %a{:href => "https://nyuad.nyu.edu/en/research/research-institute-centers.html"} Research Institute
            of
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "https://nyuad.nyu.edu/en/"} New York University in Abu Dhabi
          %p
            CQTS is concerned with fundamental questions of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+systems"} quantum systems
            relevant for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+technologies"} quantum technologies
            —
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+materials"} quantum materials
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+information"} quantum information
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+sensing"} quantum sensing
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+computing"} quantum computing
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+algorithms"} quantum algorithms
            — with a hallmark focus on foundations of the oft neglected but long-term necessary aspect of
            %strong
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+quantum+computing"} topological stabilization
            via hardware based on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+order"} topologically ordered
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+phases+of+matter"} phases
            of
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+materials"} quantum materials
          %div{:style => "float:left;margin:-35px 15px -10px 0px;"}
            %img{:alt => "the two kinds of quantum technologies", :src => "/nlab/files/TwoKindsOfQuantumTechnology.png", :width => "420"}/
          %p
            To this end, the theory heart of the center develops understanding of otherwise elusive
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/non-perturbative+field+theory"} strongly cloupled/correlated
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/condensed+matter"} condensed matter
            (such as
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fractional+quantum+Hall+systems"} fractional quantum Hall systems
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometric+engineering+of+quantum+field+theories"} geometric engineering
            on
            = succeed "\u201D" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-branes"} branes
            = succeed "&rbrack;," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Engineering+of+Anyons+on+M5-Probes"} SS25a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/QS"} topology-aware
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+programming+languages"} quantum programming languages
            \&amp;lbrack;
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Quantum+Language+via+Linear+Homotopy+Types"}> SS25b
            ,
            = succeed "&rbrack;" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/FQH+Anyons"} SS25c
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+homotopy+theory"} stable
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+theory"} homotopy theory
            – an approach informed by
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/high+energy+physics"} high energy physics
            and
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+topology"} algebraic topology
            = succeed "s" do
              %em Quantum Lab
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spin+resonance+qbit"} spin-based
            %a{:href => "trapped-ion+quantum+computing#ReferencesTrappedNeutralAtoms"} cold atom
            platforms for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+sensing"} quantum sensing
            \&amp;lbrack;
            %a{:href => "spin+resonance+qbit#EqubalNov22"}> Eq22
            \&amp;rbrack; and related
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+technologies"} quantum technologies
            (such as
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+key+distribution"} quantum key distribution
          %p
