              %p
                video:
                %a{:href => "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YiQNAgcwZYQ"} YT
              %blockquote
                %p
                  This talk provides an introduction and survey of recent developments in
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/AQFT"} algebraic QFT
                  on
                  = succeed "." do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lorentzian+manifolds"} Lorentzian manifolds
