                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+theory"} string theory
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tadpole+cancellation"} tadpole cancellation
                  conditions. Mathematically, this is reflecting a well-known connection between certain
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+K-theory"} K-theory
                  and
                  = succeed "." do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cobordism+groups"} cobordism groups
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/codimension"} codimension
                  one
