                  %a{:href => "derived+algebraic+geometry#ToenVezzosi04"} Töen-Vezzosi’s homotopical algebraic geometry
                  to the theory of
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derived+manifolds"} derived manifolds
                  of
                  %a{:href => "derived+smooth+manifold#Spivak08"} Spivak
                  and
                  = succeed "." do
                    %a{:href => "derived+smooth+manifold#CarchediSteffens19"} Carchedi-Steffens
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/scalar+field+theory"} scalar field theory
                  and
                  = succeed "." do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yang-Mills+theory"} Yang-Mills theory
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantisation"} quantisation
