              %p
                %strong High-fidelity universal quantum computation with symmetric qubit clusters
              %blockquote
                %p
                  Designing a physical device that maintains the error rate for each quantum processing operation low is one of the most arduous issues for the implementation of a scalable
                  = succeed "." do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+computer"} quantum computer
