              %blockquote
                %p
                  We present a
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+computing"} quantum computational
                  framework for
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+topology"} algebraic topology
