                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Howe+duality"} Howe duality
                  works in the symplectic case and then talk about the results we obtained in our paper with H. Salmasian. &amp;lbrack;
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2208.09746"}> arXiv:2208.09746
                  \&amp;rbrack;
