                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Fell+bundles"} Fell bundles
                  and the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/C%2A-algebra"} C*-algebraic
                  picture allows a full computation of the associated K-groups at least in low dimensions. I will also draw some parallels of our results with the
                  = succeed "." do
