                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+measurement"} measurement
                  scenario consists of a set of measurements and outcomes, whereas simplicial distributions can be defined for spaces of measurements and outcomes. Our approach unifies and goes beyond two earlier approaches: the sheaf-theoretic (
