              %p
                cf:
                %a{:href => "TQFT#Torzewska22"} arXiv:2208.14504
              %blockquote
                %p
                  I will begin by explaining the construction of a
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category"} category
                  = succeed "," do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi CofCos
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} CofCos
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/objects"} objects
                  are
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+spaces"} topological spaces
                  and whose
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/morphisms"} morphisms
                  are
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cofibrant+object"} cofibrant
