                  Eilenberg—MacLane spectra is much more complicated. For the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cyclic+group"} cyclic group
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
