                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stack"} stacky
                  perspective and illustrate why this point of view offers a promising solution to the open problem (motivated by
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gauge+theory"} gauge theory
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+category+theory"} higher categorical
                  analog of the above-mentioned equivalence, where the interplay between causality and determinism acquires a
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+theory"} homotopical
                  flavour.
