              %blockquote
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/global+symmetry"} Global symmetries
                  are extremely useful in the study of
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+field+theories"} quantum field theories
                  (QFTs). Remarkably, the notion of global symmetry in QFT has undergone a
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+symmetry"} dramatic generalization
