              %p
                slides:
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Yu-CQTS-May2025.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
              %p
                cf.:
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.07299"} arXiv:2411.07299
              %blockquote
                %p
                  The
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Green-Schwarz+anomaly+cancellation"} Green-Schwarz anomaly cancellation
                  condition says that the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/target+space"} target space
                  of
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/heterotic+string+theory"} heterotic string theory
                  must come with a
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+structure"} string structure
                  for the theory to be consistent. In this talk we discuss a new
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tangential+structure"} tangential structure
                  called
                  = succeed "," do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %msup
                            %mi string
                            %mi h
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} string^h
                  = succeed "," do
